      "message": "In encodeGetPortTelemetryCountersRequest() (lines 1765-1768 in NvidiaGpuMctpVdm.cpp), two bytes are packed after the common header.\n\nSince this packs 2 bytes, defining getPortTelemetryCountersRequestSize as commonRequestSize + 1 leaves the buffer 1 byte too short. \n\nWhen encodeGetPortTelemetryCountersRequest() runs, PackBuffer fails on the second pack and returns EINVAL, causing requestEncoded to remain false and disabling telemetry polling in update()",
